flowchart LR
    CLIENT[客户端]

    subgraph SERVER[服务端]
        GW[网关]
        APP[应用层]
        SVC[业务服务]
        WORKER[异步 Worker]
    end

    subgraph DATA[数据与中间件]
        DB[(数据库)]
        REDIS[(Redis)]
        MQ[(消息队列)]
    end

    EXT[第三方服务]

    CLIENT --> GW
    GW --> APP
    APP --> SVC
    SVC --> DB
    SVC --> REDIS
    SVC --> MQ
    MQ --> WORKER
    SVC --> EXT
